      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FABERGE TZAR (3) is worth another try. Was tested over 2000m and in open class last time and was well off best. Form at the mile prior was very good. Back in class and gets a chance to atone. HOPELESS ROMANTIC (2) was fifth here behind Leveraged Buyout two back in the Guineas then seventh behind the same horse in the NT Derby. Well back in grade for this and is another worth another chance. STOMP'EM (1) is racing well for the new yard, scoring at the latest over 1300m by a space. Returns to the mile but is fit and in form and should run well. THE ACCELATOR (4) backs up quickly off a distant second behind Fury here and should go well. KIEFFER (5) comes through the Bollon race and can sneak into the finish.",
